      "content": "The Arlula API provides programmatic access to satellite imagery ordering, archive search, tasking, and earth observation data services. The API covers four main areas: Archive (historical imagery search and ordering), Tasking (future satellite capture scheduling), Orders Management (order tracking and resource downloads), and connection testing.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Arlula Support",
